{"id": "rijks-20025938", "status": "ok", "meta": "A servant girl cuts something at a table by a window in a kitchen with a bird cage, painted by Willem van Odekercken in 1631.", "about": "In a kitchen a servant girl cuts or cleans something on a table by a window. A colander, a pot and a bucket stand on the table, and a bird cage hangs over the window. Willem van Odekercken painted it in 1631. Mr. and Mrs. Kessler-Hülsmann of Kapelle op den Bosch gave it to the Rijksmuseum.", "museum_record": "https://www.rijksmuseum.nl/nl/collectie/object/SK-A-3334--37360af20ce467cb9b6a0207e70f587c", "inventory_number": "", "dimensions": "", "credit_line": "", "sources": ["https://www.rijksmuseum.nl/nl/collectie/object/SK-A-3334--37360af20ce467cb9b6a0207e70f587c", "https://id.rijksmuseum.nl/20025938"], "check": "clean"}
